# pki/ generated TLS material — NEVER commit these.
#
# The committed pki/*.sh scripts, lib.sh, and systemd/ units stay tracked; only
# the CA-signed certs/keys/CRLs (regenerated by pki/pki-new.sh and
# pki/renew-server-cert.sh) are ignored here. CA keys live in ~/.ssh/gitd-ca/
# (outside the repo); pki/ holds the staged upload set destined for SSM.
*.key
*.crt
*.crl
*.csr
